; A chapel in Questeria, smaller and older than the temple: the altar at the far end under its tapestry
; with a candle either side, the keeper in front of it, a runner up the aisle between the pews, two at
; prayer, and the hymn books on their shelf. Every chapel that's this one inside comes back out its own
; door.

